data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"id":"ig_075d474cc10e4e89016a04745242348191a91a2b08a73a2019","type":"image_generation_call","status":"generating","action":"generate","background":"opaque","output_format":"png","quality":"medium","result":"","revised_prompt":"Create a single polished game UI prototype image in 16:9 horizontal composition, 1920x1080 feel, for a top-down multiplayer card/strategy battle arena. Visual review mockup only, no gameplay objects. Center the composition on a large clean rectangular arena occupying about 58% of screen width and 55% of screen height, empty and ready for play. The center arena should have a subtle pale tactical grid, refined corner markers, and a calm luminous frame, but no pieces, props, text, icons, labels, numbers, or symbols.\n\nAround the arena, show four available player seats: top, bottom, left, and right. Top and bottom seats are compact horizontal panels. Left and right seats are compact vertical panels. Each player zone includes simple placeholder UI elements only: an avatar frame, a few card slot shapes, compact resource pip indicators, and a small turn/status control shape. These should look clean and elegant, clearly indicating support for 2, 3, or 4 players by showing all four seat positions, but without any readable text.\n\nStyle: modern refined pixel art, anime-inspired but restrained, not retro. Polished contemporary digital board-game UI for a modern indie strategy/card game. Bright, clean, calm, slightly fantasy-tech. Use smooth pixel-art surfaces and refined materials: light stone, matte ceramic, frosted glass, pale fabric, subtle luminous edge accents. Crisp thin outlines, clean geometry, restrained ornament. Palette uses four soft accents distributed tastefully: cool blue, muted rose, fresh green, soft amber, with moderate saturation. Background should be minimal modern-fantasy, like a soft abstract courtyard floor or clean arena platform with very low detail.\n\nAvoid: retro board game styling, leather, brass, parchment, antique wood, medieval ornament, old courtyard, Victorian trim, heavy filigree, overly cartoony mobile-game style, candy colors, toy-like glossy buttons, huge icons, chibi feel, dark gloomy colors, grunge, realism, photography, dense scenery, castles, waterfalls, trees, flowers. No characters, no monsters, no enemies, no gameplay pieces, no watermarks, no logos. Keep the center open and uncluttered. High visual clarity, premium UI concept art, cohesive layout, symmetrical and readable.","size":"1672x941"},"output_index":0,"sequence_number":7}

